:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk Nest []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You land on the ground. <<childname>> hops around near the bushes, apparently looking for something.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你降落在地面上。<<childname>>在灌木附近跳来跳去，似乎在寻找着什么。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The other chicks land with you, watching <<childname>> search curiously.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      其他孩子也跟着你们降落，好奇地看着<<childname>>搜索。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You look around, trying to spot some prey or something shiny, but all you can see are a few scattered branches and leaves. You tap <<childname>> and point at a tumbleweed not far away, asking whether <<childhim>> is looking for this.
    <br>
    <<childname>> looks in the direction you point and immediately gives an excited chatter. <<childHe>> trots over and buries their head in a big tangle of branches to search.
    <br><br>
    You
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你环顾四周，试图发现一些猎物或者闪亮的东西，但你的视野里只有一些零散的树枝和树叶。你轻拍<<childname>>，指了指不远处的一团风滚草，想问问<<childhim>>是不是在找这个。
    <br>
    <<childname>>看向你指的方向，立刻发出了兴奋的叽喳声。<<childHe>>小跑过去，在一大堆纠缠的树枝间埋头翻找起来。
    <br><br>
    你
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      s
    <<option 'CN'>>
      们
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    follow as well. As you get closer, you suddenly realize that this pile of branch debris is tangled together in an odd way; though most of it is worn down, you can still tell it was once tightly woven into shape.
    <span class="blue">This is the wreckage of an abandoned nest. Considering your current location, it is very likely the nest you saw when you picked up <<childname>>.</span> Whether from wind and weather or from being damaged by something, it has broken apart so badly that you can barely recognize it.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    也跟了上去。走近后你才忽然发现，这堆树枝的残骸反常地纠缠在一块儿，尽管大部分被磨损，但你还是能看出它们曾经被紧密地编织成型。
    <span class="blue">这是一个废弃的巢的残骸。考虑到你们目前的位置，这很可能是你捡到<<childname>>时看到的那个巢。</span>不知道是由于风吹日晒还是外力破坏，它已经碎裂到你几乎认不出来了。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<switch $speech_attitude>>
  <<case "bratty">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "What, did you hide something good in there?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "怎么，你藏过什么好东西在里面吗？"
    <</language>>
  <<case "meek">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "D-do you miss your old nest?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "你、你想念自己的旧巢了吗？"
    <</language>>
  <<case "neutral">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Did you leave something in the nest?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "你有什么东西落在巢里了吗？"
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You crouch beside <<childname>> and reach out to help <<childHe>> search through it.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你蹲在<<childname>>的身边，伸手帮<<childHe>>一起翻找起来。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The other chicks come over too and rummage through the nest material with you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      其他孩子也围上来，一起扒拉这堆巢料。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').count is 1>>
  <<lanLink ["Continue (0:05)", "继续 (0:05)"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk Nest Special">>
    <<bird_pass 5>>
  <</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<lanLink ["Continue (0:05)", "继续 (0:05)"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk Nest 2">>
    <<bird_pass 5>>
  <</lanLink>>
<</if>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk Nest 2 []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Minutes pass as you break apart most of the branches still barely tangled together, but you find nothing except some small insects. <<childname>> chirps sadly and flies up alone to a high branch.
    <br><br>
    "<<childname>>!" You call <<childhim>> loudly, but <<childhe>> perches up there looking into the distance and does not move.
    <br><br>
    This reminds you of the children who have just been brought to the orphanage.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    几分钟过去了，你们掰碎了大部分还勉强纠缠在一块儿的树枝，但除了一些小虫以外什么也没发现。<<childname>>伤心地啾啾叫着，独自飞到了高处的一根树杈上。
    <br><br>
    "<<childname>>！"你大声呼唤<<childhim>>，但<<childhe>>停在上面看着远方，没有移动。
    <br><br>
    这让你想起那些刚刚被送到孤儿院来的孩子们。
<</language>>
<<gtrauma>><<trauma 3>>
<br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    For some children, accepting life as an orphan always takes time. You only hope you can give <<childhe>> a better life and better memories.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    对于有一些孩子来说，接受作为孤儿的生活总是需要一些时间。你只希望你能为<<childhe>>带来更美好的生活和更美好的回忆。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> give worried chirps and fly over to <<childname>>'s side to keep <<childhe>> company.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>发出担心的叽喳叫声，飞到<<childname>>身边陪着<<childhe>>。
  <</language>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You head toward the tree, intending to go to your child's side. As you reach the base of the tree, you suddenly feel the ground dip underfoot, as if you stepped on uneven ground. You look down and find a small pit that has been hastily filled in.
    <br>
    You realize something, look up and call your child again, then start digging at the ground. Before long, a faint glimmer of light leaks out of the soil.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你向那棵树移动，准备赶到你的孩子身边去。走到树根附近时，你忽然感到脚下一陡，好像踩到了一块不平整的地面。你低头，发现脚下有一块被潦草填埋过的小土坑。
    <br>
    你意识到了什么，再次抬头呼唤你的孩子，随后开始挖掘这块地面。没一会儿，土里就漏出了一丝闪亮的微光。
<</language>>
<br>
<<icon "antiques/antique-gold-ring.png">>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <span class="gold">A ring made of gold, set with a black gem, surrounded by carvings that look like grapes.</span>
    <br>
    <<childname>> lands beside you, excitedly
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <span class="gold">一枚黄金制成的戒指，上面镶嵌着一颗黑色宝石，被一些看起来像是葡萄的雕刻花纹所包围。</span>
    <br>
    <<childname>>落在你的身边，激动地
<</language>>
<<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("smiling through tears","破涕为笑") : lanSwitch("chirping","唧唧鸣叫")>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    . <<childHe>> circles you happily, making all kinds of excited calls. It seems this is what <<childHe>> was looking for.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    。<<childHe>>绕着你开心地转圈，发出各种各样的兴奋叫声。看来这就是<<childHe>>在找的东西了。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The other chicks do not understand, but they cheer up too because of its shining light.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      其他孩子不明所以，但也因为它闪亮的光芒而开心起来。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<childname>> dives into your arms, trilling and nuzzling against you. <<childHe>> looks content.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<childname>>扑进你的怀里，颤鸣着轻蹭你。<<childHe>>看起来心满意足。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Take the ring", "收下戒指"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk RingForAntique">><</lanLink>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Leave the ring with your child", "把戒指留给你的孩子"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk RingForToy">>
  <<set $BirdTower.ring.kept to 1>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk Nest Special []
<<effects>>
<<set _colourname = setup.colours.eyes_map[$childRecords[$orphanHawkChildId].features.eyeColour].name>>
<<set _colourEye = setup.colours.eyes_map[$childRecords[$orphanHawkChildId].features.eyeColour].variable>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Minutes pass as you break apart most of the branches still barely tangled together, but you find nothing except some small insects. <<childname>> chirps sadly and flies up alone to perch on a high branch.
    <br><br>
    "<<childname>>!" You call <<childhim>> loudly, but <<childhe>> perches up there looking into the distance and does not move.
    <br><br>
    This reminds you of the children who have just been brought to the orphanage.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    几分钟过去了，你们掰碎了大部分还勉强纠缠在一块儿的树枝，但除了一些小虫以外什么也没发现。<<childname>>伤心地啾啾叫着，独自飞到一颗高处的树杈上待着。
    <br><br>
    "<<childname>>！"你大声呼唤<<childhim>>，但<<childhe>>停在上面看着远方，没有移动。
    <br><br>
    这让你想起那些刚刚被送到孤儿院来的孩子们。
<</language>>
<<gtrauma>><<trauma 3>>
<br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    For some children, accepting life as an orphan always takes time. You only hope you can give <<childhe>> a better life and better memories.
    <br><br>
    You head toward the tree, intending to go to your child's side. As you reach the base of the tree, you suddenly feel the ground dip underfoot, as if you stepped on uneven ground. You look down and find a small pit that has been hastily filled in.
    <br>
    You realize something, look up and call your child again, then start digging at the ground. Before long, a faint glimmer of light leaks out of the soil.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    对于有一些孩子来说，接受作为孤儿的生活总是需要一些时间。你只希望你能为<<childhe>>带来更美好的生活和更美好的回忆。
    <br><br>
    你向那棵树前进，准备赶到你的孩子身边去。走到树根附近时，你忽然感到脚下一陡，好像踩到了一块不平整的地面。你低头，发现脚下有一块被潦草填埋过的小土坑。
    <br>
    你意识到了什么，再次抬头呼唤你的孩子，随后开始挖掘这块地面。没一会儿，土里就漏出了一丝闪亮的微光。
<</language>>
<br>
<<babyhawkicon "Gold Ring">>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <span class="gold">A ring made of gold, set with a
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <span class="gold">一枚黄金制成的戒指，上面镶嵌着一颗
<</language>>
<<print _colourname>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    gem, surrounded by carvings that look like grapes.</span>
    <br>
    <<childname>> lands beside you, excitedly
  <<option 'CN'>>
    宝石，被一些看起来像是葡萄的雕刻花纹所包围。</span>
    <br>
    <<childname>>落在你的身边，激动地
<</language>>
<<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("smiling through tears","破涕为笑") : lanSwitch("chirping","唧唧鸣叫")>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    . <<childHe>> circles you happily, making all kinds of excited calls. It seems this is what <<childHe>> was looking for.
    <br><br>
    You hold the ring up to the light, and the dazzling gleam refracted by the gem quiets <<childname>>, who stares at it intently. You realize the gem shares the same color as <span @class="'eye-' + _colourEye.replace(/ /g, '-')"><span class="colour-eye" style="color:#6E4E11;">your child's eyes</span></span>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    。<<childHe>>绕着你开心地转圈，发出各种各样的兴奋叫声。看来这就是<<childHe>>在找的东西了。
    <br><br>
    你迎着光举起戒指，宝石折射出的炫目光芒让<<childname>>安静下来，认真地盯着它。你意识到这颗宝石和<span @class="'eye-' + _colourEye.replace(/ /g, '-')"><span class="colour-eye" style="color:#6E4E11;">你孩子的眼睛</span></span>共享同一种颜色。
<</language>>
<<lltrauma>><<trauma -10>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<childname>> burrows into your arms, <<childhis>> feathers brushing lightly against you. <<childHe>> looks content.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<childname>>钻进你的怀里，<<childhis>>的羽毛轻蹭着你。<<childHe>>看起来心满意足。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Leave the ring with your child", "把戒指留给你的孩子"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk RingForToy">>
  <<set $BirdTower.ring.kept to 2>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk RingForAntique []
<<effects>>
<<set $antiquemoney += 3000>>
<<museumAntiqueStatus "antiquegoldring" "found">>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You take the ring. The museum curator will be interested in it.
    <br><br>
    <<babyhawks>> watch you put the ring away, then happily leave with you.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你收下了这枚戒指。博物馆馆长会对它感兴趣的。
    <br><br>
    <<babyhawks>>看着你放好这枚戒指，高兴地跟着你一起离开。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<set $bird.hunts.weight += 0.2>>
<<set $bird.hunts.lootAmount += 1>>
<<set $BirdTower.ring.hint to 2>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt OrphanHawk RingForToy []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You hand the ring to <<childname>>. <<childHe>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你把这枚戒指递给<<childname>>。<<childHe>>从你手里
<</language>>
<<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("takes","接过") : lanSwitch("picks it up in their beak","叼过")>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    ring, and chirps happily at you.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    戒指，对你高兴地叽喳叫。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<set $bird.hunts.weight += 0.2>>
<<set $bird.hunts.lootAmount += 1>>
<<set $BirdTower.ring.hint to 1>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
